++## EAP 17-species phase generator status (2026-07-26)
++
++The 17-species coated-sphere EAP generator and normalized P11/P12/P33 API are
++included.  Species-specific phytoplankton scattering is intentionally disabled
++in the constituent water model until a validated forward-peak treatment is
++available for the current L=200 water moment representation.
++
++- Chl without `--ocrt-phyto-group`: phytoplankton absorption only; detritus scattering.
++- Chl with explicit `--ocrt-phyto-group`: fail-loud, exit code 2.
++- Fixed-bulk `--iop-mie-phase` truncation remains available for diagnostics and validation.
