+++
+++### 16.3 수렴 근거
+++
+++pure water 443 nm, SZA40, VZA60, RAA90 sweep 결과:
+++
+++```text
+++200 m  (tau 2.388): deep reference 대비 I 약 -0.7%
+++500 m  (tau 5.971): 약 -0.0005%
+++1000 m (tau 11.941): 약 -0.00002%
+++adaptive no-cap (tau 20): reference
+++```
