+++++- flat-interface analytical Mueller limit
+++++- wind→0 continuity
+++++- TAW/TWA reciprocity
+++++- flux energy conservation
+++++- Snell–Bouguer/étendue `L/n^2` invariance
+++++- principal-plane U=0
+++++- independent Jones-vector basis calculation
